  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Combating Information Redacted in Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project goal is to improve the capacity of the Egyptian government to combat human trafficking by strengthening the national identification and referral mechanism, and providing assistance and reintegration services for identified victims.</narrative>
